'''Kimono Champs''' (振袖選手権, ''Furisode Senshuken'', '''Furisode Championship''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]].

==Effect==
Research Power UP (L): All Cats' recharge times are reduced by 79 frames (2.63 sec).

